    "created_at": "2024-05-24T02:35:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-05-24T02:35:54Z",
    "body": "But that happens after the pipe operation - the body's stream gets set to the result of piping its current stream through `transformStream`. And it's that piping operation itself that immediately fails, as the readable stream it is provided (the body's current stream) is locked and closed.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
