    "created_at": "2024-12-07T20:55:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-12-07T20:56:28Z",
    "body": "The stream that we read in `fully read` is not the same one passed to `handover`.\r\n\r\n- It calls \"Read all bytes\" ([fully read](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#body-fully-read) .5), which converts the stream to bytes\r\n- Then these bytes go to  [main fetch](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-main-fetch) 22/3/2: Set response’s [body](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-response-body) to bytes [as a body](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#byte-sequence-as-a-body).\r\n- \"As a body\": extracts bytes, and Set response’s [body](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-response-body) to bytes [as a body](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#byte-sequence-as-a-body). See [extract](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-bodyinit-extract) 4.:  set stream to a [new](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#new) [ReadableStream](https://streams.spec.whatwg.org/#readablestream) object, and [set up](https://streams.spec.whatwg.org/#readablestream-set-up-with-byte-reading-support) stream with byte reading support.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
