    "created_at": "2024-12-10T13:39:50Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-12-10T13:39:50Z",
    "body": "Hi all - thanks for the help on this one, we traced the issue down to a subtle bug where the stream created from extracting the body as bytes was not being used later on in the fetch response handover. Apologies for taking anyone's time on this one!",
